        {
            "_id": "9wgccmQ1VDhfkuS8",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Sorrowful Gaze",
            "sort": 1200000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The shadow stitcher focuses their sorrow and anguish into their gaze, forcing another to feel what they feel, if even for a moment. A creature the shadow stitcher can see must attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round as tears well up in their eyes.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for 1 minute as their eyes fill with tears. At the end of each of its turns, they can attempt a @Check[will|dc:26] save to end the condition early.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is blinded and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute while lost in sorrow.</p>"
                },
